repository-code: 'https://github.com/kiwama/radiographic-bpd-score'
abstract: >-
  Inference code and trained model weights for a deep-learning radiographic
  bronchopulmonary dysplasia (BPD) likelihood score computed from lung field
  segmentation and patch-level classification of chest radiographs of
  extremely preterm infants.
keywords:
  - bronchopulmonary dysplasia
  - chest radiography
  - deep learning
  - preterm infant
  - lung segmentation
